#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:1
msgid "Type System"
msgstr "类型系统"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:3
msgid ""
"This page lists the data types supported by TileLang and how to specify them "
"in kernels. For full details and the authoritative list, see the API "
"Reference (`autoapi/tilelang/index`) and `tilelang.language.v2.dtypes`."
msgstr ""
"本页面列出了 TileLang 支持的数据类型以及如何在内核中指定它们。有关完整详情和权威列表，"
"请参阅 API 参考（`autoapi/tilelang/index`）和 `tilelang.language.v2.dtypes`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:7
msgid "How to specify dtypes"
msgstr "如何指定数据类型"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:8
msgid "Use any of the following forms; TileLang normalizes them internally:"
msgstr "可以使用以下任意形式；TileLang 会在内部进行归一化："

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:9
msgid "String: `'float32'`, `'int8'`, `'bfloat16'`, ..."
msgstr "字符串：`'float32'`、`'int8'`、`'bfloat16'`、..."

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:10
msgid "TileLang dtype object: `T.float32`, `T.int8`, `T.bfloat16`, ..."
msgstr "TileLang 数据类型对象：`T.float32`、`T.int8`、`T.bfloat16`、..."

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:11
msgid "Framework dtype: `torch.float32`, `torch.int8`, `torch.bfloat16`, ..."
msgstr "框架数据类型：`torch.float32`、`torch.int8`、`torch.bfloat16`、..."

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:13
msgid "Common scalar types"
msgstr "常见标量类型"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:14
msgid "Boolean: `bool`"
msgstr "布尔型：`bool`"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:15
msgid "Signed integers: `int8`, `int16`, `int32`, `int64`"
msgstr "有符号整数：`int8`、`int16`、`int32`、`int64`"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:16
msgid "Unsigned integers: `uint8`, `uint16`, `uint32`, `uint64`"
msgstr "无符号整数：`uint8`、`uint16`、`uint32`、`uint64`"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:17
msgid "Floating‑point: `float16` (half), `bfloat16`, `float32`, `float64`"
msgstr "浮点型：`float16`（半精度）、`bfloat16`、`float32`、`float64`"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:19
msgid "Float8 and low‑precision families"
msgstr "Float8 及低精度系列"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:20
msgid ""
"Float8: `float8_e3m4`, `float8_e4m3`, `float8_e4m3b11fnuz`, `float8_e4m3fn`, "
"`float8_e4m3fnuz`, `float8_e5m2`, `float8_e5m2fnuz`, `float8_e8m0fnu`"
msgstr ""
"Float8：`float8_e3m4`、`float8_e4m3`、`float8_e4m3b11fnuz`、`float8_e4m3fn`、"
"`float8_e4m3fnuz`、`float8_e5m2`、`float8_e5m2fnuz`、`float8_e8m0fnu`"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:22
msgid "Float6: `float6_e2m3fn`, `float6_e3m2fn`"
msgstr "Float6：`float6_e2m3fn`、`float6_e3m2fn`"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:23
msgid "Float4: `float4_e2m1fn`"
msgstr "Float4：`float4_e2m1fn`"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:25
msgid "Vectorized element types (SIMD packs)"
msgstr "向量化元素类型（SIMD 打包）"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:26
msgid ""
"For many base types, vector‑packed variants are available by lane count: "
"`x2`, `x4`, `x8`, `x16`, `x32`, `x64`."
msgstr ""
"对于许多基础类型，可按通道数获取向量打包变体：`x2`、`x4`、`x8`、`x16`、`x32`、`x64`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:28
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "示例："

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:29
msgid "Integers: `int8x2`, `int8x4`, ..., `int32x2`, `int32x4`, ..."
msgstr "整数：`int8x2`、`int8x4`、...、`int32x2`、`int32x4`、..."

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:30
msgid "Unsigned: `uint8x2`, `uint8x4`, ..."
msgstr "无符号：`uint8x2`、`uint8x4`、..."

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:31
msgid "Floats: `float16x2`, `float16x4`, `float32x2`, `float32x4`, ..."
msgstr "浮点：`float16x2`、`float16x4`、`float32x2`、`float32x4`、..."

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:32
msgid ""
"Float8/6/4 families also provide `x2/x4/x8/x16/x32/x64` where applicable, e."
"g., `float8_e4m3x2`, `float8_e4m3x4`, `float6_e2m3fnx8`, `float4_e2m1fnx16`."
msgstr ""
"Float8/6/4 系列在适用情况下也提供 `x2/x4/x8/x16/x32/x64`，"
"例如 `float8_e4m3x2`、`float8_e4m3x4`、`float6_e2m3fnx8`、`float4_e2m1fnx16`。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:35
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "注意事项"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:36
msgid ""
"Availability of certain low‑precision formats (float8/6/4) depends on target "
"architecture and backend support."
msgstr ""
"某些低精度格式（float8/6/4）的可用性取决于目标架构和后端支持。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:38
msgid ""
"Choose accumulation dtypes explicitly for mixed‑precision compute (e.g., "
"GEMM with `float16` inputs and `float32` accumulators)."
msgstr ""
"对于混合精度计算，请显式选择累加数据类型（例如，使用 `float16` 输入和 `float32` 累加器"
"的 GEMM）。"

#: ../../../programming_guides/type_system.md:40
msgid ""
"The complete, up‑to‑date list is exposed in `tilelang.language.v2.dtypes` "
"and rendered in the API Reference."
msgstr ""
"完整的、最新的列表可在 `tilelang.language.v2.dtypes` 中查看，并在 API 参考中呈现。"
